{"id":"H7774","lemma":"שׁוּעָא","transliteration":"shua","sayIt":"shu-A","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Shua","meaning":"A woman of the tribe of Asher living before Israel's Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.7.32;\ndaughter of: Heber (H2268);\nsister of: Japhlet (H3310), Shomer (H7763H) and Hotham (H2369)\n§ Shua = \"wealth\"\nan Asheritess, daughter of Heber and sister to Japhlet, Shomer, and Hotham","glosses":["shua"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":32,"renderings":{"bsb":"Shua","kjv":"and Shua"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 7:32","note":"Heber became the father of Japhlet, Shomer, Hotham, and Shua their sister.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H7770","lemma":"שׁוּעַ","transliteration":"shua","gloss":"Shua"},{"id":"H1323","lemma":"בַּת","transliteration":"bat","gloss":"daughter"},{"id":"H2268","lemma":"חֶ֫בֶר","transliteration":"chever","gloss":"Heber"},{"id":"H2369","lemma":"חוֹתָם","transliteration":"chotam","gloss":"Hotham"},{"id":"H3310","lemma":"יַפְלֵט","transliteration":"yaphlet","gloss":"Japhlet"},{"id":"H7763","lemma":"שֹׁמֵר","transliteration":"shomer","gloss":"Shomer"},{"id":"H3063","lemma":"יְהוּדָה","transliteration":"yehudah","gloss":"Judah"},{"id":"H6147","lemma":"עֵר","transliteration":"er","gloss":"Er"}],"senses":[{"id":"H7774H","gloss":"Shua","relation":"H7774H = a Spelling of"},{"id":"H7774I","gloss":"(Bat)-shua","relation":"H7774I = a Part of"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}